        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="note-scope" value="&lt;b&gt;Scope notes&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Vet, customs and quarantine authorities have no API. The Transport Specialist records their decisions in the system (UC12, UC13), so they are not actors.&lt;br&gt;• There is no payment gateway (PRODUCT.md, out of scope). Staff record bank-transfer or card payments (UC30); deposit and final invoices are generated by the system.&lt;br&gt;• Sign in, sign out and registration are on the page “Account access”." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;align=left;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=8;fontSize=12;fillColor=#fffbe6;strokeColor=#b59f3b;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=6;" vertex="1" parent="p1-1">
          <mxGeometry x="330" y="2190" width="970" height="110" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
